# I rebuilt the dashboard as server rendered templates, so there is no
# node_modules or build output left to ignore. I keep this line only so a
# leftover frontend/ directory on someone's machine cannot be committed by
# accident.
/frontend/

# Database dumps carry customer names, emails and phone numbers, so I keep
# them out of the repo.
*.sql.gz
*.sql.zip
/config/Migrations/dump*.sql
clean_flow_plumbing_db.sql
# and not the team's to maintain, so I keep them on my machine.
#
# I list them by name rather than ignoring /docs/ outright, so the team can
# still add shared documentation here later. Delete a line to start tracking
# that file again. Without these entries a plain `git add -A` puts them back.
/docs/HANDOFF.md
/docs/miro-reflection-*.txt
/docs/Iteration1-Report-*.docx
/docs/API.md
/docs/SECURITY.md
/docs/ACCEPTANCE-CRITERIA.md
/docs/ADMIN-DASHBOARD-SETUP.md
/docs/seed-submissions.sql
/docs/Iteration1_RunSheet.md
/docs/Iteration1_RunSheet.docx
/docs/*

